		{
			dependencies: ["7F0000000000000B"]
			description: [
				"The &eMechanical Drill&r breaks the block in front of it, continuously, as long as it has rotation."
				""
				"&e&lOn a contraption it becomes a tunnel borer.&r Mount drills on the front of a moving Mechanical Bearing or piston contraption and it mines as it travels - which is how Create does quarries."
				""
				"&7Static drills are the standard way to break cobble from a generator, or to feed a crushing line.&r"
				""
				"&8Faster rotation means faster breaking. This is one of the few places where cranking the speed genuinely pays."
			]
			icon: "create:mechanical_drill"
			id: "7F0000000000000C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7F0100000000000C"
