			title: "&eSpout & Item Drain"
			x: -6.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7F0000000000000D"]
			description: [
				"&eFluid Pipes&r carry liquid; a &eMechanical Pump&r is what actually moves it, and it needs rotation."
				""
				"&c&lA pipe network with no pump does nothing.&r This is the number one Create fluid mistake. The pipes are passive."
				""
				"&e&lPump direction is set by rotation direction&r and shown by an arrow. Wrench the pump to flip it if the fluid is going the wrong way."
				""
				"&7Create pipes only show fluid when they are actually flowing, which makes debugging easy - a dry-looking pipe is a stalled pipe.&r"
				""
				"&8Fluid Tanks buffer, and window blocks let you see the level. Build the tank before the machine that needs it."
			]
			icon: "create:mechanical_pump"
			id: "7F0000000000000E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7F0100000000000E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
