			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7F0000000000000E"]
			description: [
				"&eFluid Tanks&r stack into multiblocks - place them in a rectangle and they merge into one large tank."
				""
				"&e&lThey have a window variant&r so you can see the level at a glance, which is more useful than it sounds when debugging a line."
				""
				"&7Tanks are the correct thing between any producer and consumer. A Spout fed directly from a pump stalls every time the pump hiccups; fed from a tank it does not.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:fluid_tank"
			id: "7F0000000000000F"
			rewards: [{
