		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000010"]
			description: [
				"&eSuper Glue&r sticks blocks to each other; a &eLinear Chassis&r grabs a configurable range of blocks in one direction."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the step everyone skips and then wonders why half their build stayed behind.&r A contraption moves only what is attached."
				""
				"&7Glue is for irregular shapes - right-click-drag over the faces you want bound. Chassis is for regular ones - set a radius with the wrench and it grabs everything in that range automatically.&r"
				""
				"&8Chassis is far less fiddly for anything rectangular. Save the glue for decoration and odd corners."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "create:super_glue"
