		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000011"]
			description: [
				"A &eMechanical Harvester&r cuts crops it passes over without breaking the farmland; a &eMechanical Plough&r tills soil and breaks non-solid blocks."
				""
				"&e&lMounted on a bearing or a moving contraption, these are a fully automatic farm&r - the contraption travels the field, harvests, and a chute or vacuum collects behind it."
				""
				"&7Unlike the Cyclic Harvester, this one leaves the crop stem intact where the plant supports it, so many crops regrow without replanting.&r"
				""
				"&8Pair with a Portable Storage Interface so the contraption unloads automatically at the end of each pass."
			]
			icon: "create:mechanical_harvester"
			id: "7F00000000000012"
			rewards: [{
