		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000012"]
			description: [
				"A &ePortable Storage Interface&r lets a moving contraption exchange items with a stationary one as it passes."
				""
				"&e&lOne on the contraption, one on the ground.&r When they line up, items transfer - the contraption pauses briefly, unloads its harvest or takes on fuel, then carries on."
				""
				"&7This is what turns a contraption from a toy into a machine. A harvester that fills up and stops is useless; one that empties itself every lap runs forever.&r"
				""
				"&8There is a fluid version too, for contraptions that need refilling rather than emptying."
			]
			icon: "create:portable_storage_interface"
