		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000017"]
			description: [
				"A &eSchematic Table&r saves and loads structures; a &eSchematicannon&r builds them for you from a chest of materials."
				""
				"&e&lThe workflow:&r select a region with a Schematic and Quill, save it at the table, place the schematic in the world to position it, then let the Schematicannon fire."
				""
				"&7It consumes real materials from an adjacent chest and gunpowder as fuel. It is not free building - it is automated building.&r"
				""
				"&e&lWorth it for anything repetitive&r - a bank of identical machine rooms, a wall of Item Vaults, a second identical farm."
				""
				"&8Also the easiest way to move a build to another island, or to another dimension."
			]
			icon: "create:schematic_table"
