		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000000"]
			description: [
				"An &eExtendo Grip&r extends your reach; a &ePotato Cannon&r fires vegetables hard enough to kill things."
				""
				"&e&lThe Extendo Grip is genuinely useful for building&r - placing blocks several metres away, or reaching into a contraption without dismantling it. Hold one in each hand for even more reach."
				""
				"&7The Potato Cannon does real damage and different ammo has different effects - some knock back, some set on fire. It is powered by your Copper Backtank.&r"
				""
				"&8Both are Create at its most Create. Neither is required. Both are worth ten minutes."
			]
			icon: {
