		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000019"]
			description: [
				"A &eCopper Backtank&r stores compressed air on your back. A &eDiving Helmet&r lets you breathe it underwater."
				""
				"&e&lThe backtank is the battery for Create's handheld tools&r - the Potato Cannon and the Extendo Grip both draw from it."
				""
				"&7Refill it by standing near a running Mechanical Press or by placing it and feeding it rotation. A netherite version holds far more.&r"
				""
				"&8Diving boots let you walk on the bottom rather than floating - useful when you are building an underwater intake, less so on a floating island."
			]
			icon: "create:copper_backtank"
			id: "7F0000000000001A"
			rewards: [{
