		{
			dependencies: ["7F0000000000001A"]
			description: [
				"&eFilters&r slot into brass funnels, smart chutes, mechanical arms and belts to control exactly what passes."
				""
				"&e&lTwo kinds:&r a plain &7Filter&r matches a list of items; an &7Attribute Filter&r matches a property - damaged, enchanted, food, smeltable, in a tag."
				""
				"&e&lAttribute filters are the powerful ones.&r 'Everything smeltable' or 'anything damaged' is a rule you can write once and never revisit as the pack grows."
				""
				"&7Filters can be set to whitelist or blacklist, and to respect or ignore stack size and NBT.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:filter"
			id: "7F0000000000001B"
			rewards: [{
