		{
			dependencies: ["7F0000000000000F"]
			description: [
				"A &eSteam Engine&r mounted on a boiler of water, heated by Blaze Burners, produces vastly more stress capacity than water wheels."
				""
				"&e&lThis is Create's real power tier.&r A modest boiler with a few engines outclasses a wall of water wheels and takes a fraction of the space."
				""
				"&e&lThe boiler scales in stages&r - more water tanks and more heat move it up levels, and each level supports more engines at higher output. The boiler's tooltip tells you exactly what it needs to reach the next level."
				""
				"&c&lSuper-heated Blaze Burners are the usual bottleneck&r, and they want a steady blaze cake or lava supply. Plan the fuel before the boiler."
				""
				"&7Feed the output into a Crafts & Additions Alternator and this becomes your whole base's electricity too.&r"
			]
			icon: "create:steam_engine"
			id: "7F0000000000001C"
			rewards: [{
