			description: [
				"&e&lYou have run the whole of Create.&r"
				""
				"Rotation you can switch, reverse and dial to an exact speed. Belts, chutes and arms moving everything. Contraptions that harvest, drill and unload themselves. A boiler making more stress than a river of water wheels. And a machine that copies your builds for you."
				""
				"&7Create is the only mod in this pack where the machine you build is genuinely &lyours&r - two players solving the same problem will not produce the same factory.&r"
				""
				"&8Everything after this runs on Forge Energy. But the Precision Mechanism that opened it came out of a line of Deployers you sequenced by hand."
			]
